    - lineId: citywide_alert-brief-03
      textKey: narrative.citywide_alert.brief-03
      englishFallback: I can request one Smoke screen on a marked lane. You decide
        whether to approve it. Approval covers that action alone; declining or continuing
        without it leaves command with you and consumes no Fuel.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7dcacf423d204df992fe804587ba066, type: 3}
