    - lineId: citywide_alert-debrief-02
      textKey: narrative.citywide_alert.debrief-02
      englishFallback: The attack timings align with the last active Civic Relay
        nodes. Ash Line's local strikes and Vanguard's corridor pressure share the
        same schedule. I have preserved that connection as evidence.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13c5d72fc8460484c9e21a1f7aca2744, type: 3}
